{
  "name": "底部芝麻功",
  "status": "structured",
  "timeframe": "1d",
  "source_pages": [21, 22, 23, 24, 25],
  "source": "底部芝麻功强调在潜收集完成后的回档过程中，连续出现极度萎缩的小成交量和小K线，说明浮筹被洗净，随后一旦重新放量上升就可能进入新的拉升阶段。",
  "source_summary": "连续缩量到极致的底部整理区间，可视为底部芝麻功；若随后重新放量上行，信号更强。",
  "comment": "当前优先提取日线可执行部分：连续低量与底部区域确认；原文对K线实体大小的细节未完全量化。",
  "computable_from_daily_ocvhl": true,
  "required_fields": [
    "low",
    "close",
    "volume"
  ],
  "warmup_bars": 30,
  "indicator_type": "volume_price_rule",
  "params": {
    "low_window": 20,
    "sesame_consecutive_days": 3,
    "reexpand_keep_days": 2
  },
  "series": [
    {
      "id": "vol_ma_5",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "volume",
      "window": 5,
      "description": "5日均量"
    },
    {
      "id": "vol_ma_10",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "volume",
      "window": 10,
      "description": "10日均量"
    },
    {
      "id": "vol_ma_20",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "volume",
      "window": 20,
      "description": "20日均量"
    },
    {
      "id": "low_20",
      "op": "lowest",
      "field": "low",
      "window": "$params.low_window",
      "description": "最近N日最低价"
    },
    {
      "id": "close_prev",
      "op": "ref",
      "field": "close",
      "window": 1,
      "description": "前一日收盘价"
    }
  ],
  "events": [],
  "rules": {
    "latest_match": {
      "op": "or",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "op": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "op": "consecutive",
              "length": "$params.sesame_consecutive_days",
              "condition": {
                "op": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "op": "compare",
                    "left": "volume",
                    "operator": "<",
                    "right": "vol_ma_5"
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "compare",
                    "left": "volume",
                    "operator": "<",
                    "right": "vol_ma_10"
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "compare",
                    "left": "volume",
                    "operator": "<",
                    "right": "vol_ma_20"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "compare",
              "left": "low",
              "operator": "<=",
              "right": "low_20"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "op": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "op": "within",
              "window": "$params.reexpand_keep_days",
              "condition": {
                "op": "consecutive",
                "length": "$params.sesame_consecutive_days",
                "condition": {
                  "op": "and",
                  "conditions": [
                    {
                      "op": "compare",
                      "left": "volume",
                      "operator": "<",
                      "right": "vol_ma_5"
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "compare",
                      "left": "volume",
                      "operator": "<",
                      "right": "vol_ma_10"
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "compare",
                      "left": "volume",
                      "operator": "<",
                      "right": "vol_ma_20"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "compare",
              "left": "volume",
              "operator": ">",
              "right": "vol_ma_5"
            },
            {
              "op": "compare",
              "left": "close",
              "operator": ">",
              "right": "close_prev"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "calculation_steps": [
    "计算5/10/20日均量和最近low_window日最低价。",
    "若最新交易日已经连续sesame_consecutive_days天满足 volume 同时低于 5/10/20 日均量，且当前低点落在最近low_window日低位附近，则视为芝麻点阶段成立。",
    "如果最新交易日不处于芝麻点阶段，但最近reexpand_keep_days日内刚经历过芝麻点阶段，且当前量能重新高于5日均量、收盘价高于前一日，也可视为芝麻功后的放量启动。"
  ],
  "signal_day_definition": "连续极度缩量且位于底部区间的最后一天，或其后首个重新放量上升的交易日，视为底部芝麻功信号日。",
  "manual_review_needed": [
    "原文中的“小阴小阳、十字星、回档越浅越好”未被完全量化，当前仅用连续低量和低位区间近似表达。",
    "sesame_consecutive_days=3 与 reexpand_keep_days=2 均为默认建议参数，需后续回测确认。"
  ],
  "implementation_notes": [
    "该规则使用 volume 的极度萎缩与 low 的底部位置来近似芝麻点。",
    "如果后续需要更严格的芝麻K线定义，建议引擎支持实体振幅或区间振幅算子。"
  ],
  "explain": "底部芝麻功被近似为连续极低量的底部整理，外加其后的首次放量转强。"
}
